	(text "ROM size: 0x10000 (A0-A15)\nA16=0, only the first 64KB of ROM is read\nROM repeats every 0x10000 and boot code is in the right place\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.138 248.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9837cfed-a569-4e77-ae47-04b9f1506f8c")
	)
	(text "RAM size: 0x08000 (A0-A14)\nROM size: 0x20000 (A0-A16)\nSelects from A19..A17:\nCS0 = RAM (0x00000...0x1FFFF)\nCS7 = ROM (0xE0000...0xFFFFF)\n(ram will repeat 4 times)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 228.6 135.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ed7a74b6-8ccf-4b7c-9d46-e7b1e2356834")
	)
	(text_box "Project1: Minimal code runner with sram and rom\n- P8088\n- SRAM:\n  - HY62256B 32KB (A0-A14)\n- Flash:\n  - AM29F010B-120 128KB (A0-A16)\n- 74LS573 latches x3\n- 74HC138 decoder\n- 74HC245 data driver\n\n8088 pins:\nAD0-A19 to 2x 573 latches (A0-A7 and A16-A19)\n- A0-A14 to RAM (bottom half from latch)\n- A0-A16 to ROM (bottom half from latch)\n- A17-A19 to 138 ROM/RAM decoder\nIO/M also to 138 RAM/ROM decoder\nAD0 to D7 to:\n- ROM\n- RAM\n- OTHER\n- optional: (D0-D7 to 74HC245 schottkey before all else)\nNMI: 10k R down\nRESET: 10k up\nDT/R: to optional 74HC245 schottkey\nDEN: to optional 74HC245 schottkey\nWR, RD: To gates that output IOWR/IORD/MEMWR/MEMRD for 138s\nMN/MX: 1, minimum mode fixed\nTEST: 0, fixed\nHOLD: 0, fixed, input\nHLDA: NC (output)\nSSO: NC (output)\nINTA: NC (output)\nINTR: 0 10k (input)\nREADY: connect to clkgen\nCLK: connect to clkgen\n\n\n\nROM:\n- A16=0 (first 64KB repeats)\n- A0-A15 from 573 latches\n- CS from 138 decoder (Y7=pin7)\n- OE to MEMRD\n- WR = 1 (readonly)\n\nRAM:\n- A0-A15 from 573 latches\n- CS from 138 decoder (Y0=pin15)\n- OE to MEMRD\n- WR to MEMWR\n\nLCD:\n- CS from 138 decoder (Y4=pin11)\n\n\nRAM and ROM DECODER:\nDecoder has 3 inputs(low,low,high) and 3 address\nShould place ram at 0x0 with A15-19 and IO/M\nIO/M must be low, the other 2x G pins are fixed to enable\nWith A19,A18,A17 on address, CS0 is RAM and CS7 is ROM\nWith A16 and A15 ignored for RAM but used for ROM:\n- The highest 128KB (0xE0000) enables ROM"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 12.7 0)
		(size 76.2 128.6707)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dcb25276-a372-4d40-bc22-9c3ae34cfd4a")
	)
